      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"goblin soil\"?? lol what does that even mean? i just mean the dirt in the pot. and why do you keep bringing up goblins? i'm just trying to save my plant. \n\ncan you just tell me if i should add fertilizer or if i should change the soil? i'm confused about what's actually causing the yellow leaves.",
      "source": "evaluator"
